  "Nearly 77,000 people watched this promotion battle.",
  "Manchester City faced Gillingham at Wembley Stadium on 30 May 1999.",
  "The match determined the final team moving up to the First Division.",
  "Gillingham beat Preston North End and Manchester City defeated Wigan Athletic to reach the final.",
  "This was Gillingham’s first trip to Wembley, while Manchester City had played there 11 times.",
  "The game remained scoreless until the 81st minute."
